    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόοψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>foreseeing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>seeing before one,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ οὔσης τῆς προόψεως ᾗ . .</span>
			since there was no <i>seeing</i> where . ., cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.29
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσόψεως</span> codd.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>provision,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					880.15
				</span></i>
			 (Pizus, <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>).</div>
